From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 16:01:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: Report G16 submission backpressure that cannot
 clear

Admission returns EBUSY when a firmware resource is exhausted, and the
worker retries every 10 s without logging. Every resource involved is
released when work retires, so EBUSY with no flights outstanding can
never clear: it is an accounting leak, and submissions stall forever
with an idle GPU while the client waits on its fence. CS2 loads under
muvm stalled exactly like that, with no kernel output.

Always report, once per boot per resource, backpressure with nothing in
flight, as well as queue-event-slot and ASID exhaustion, with current
occupancy. Transient pressure under load stays behind fw_trace & 2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RvQieG9SGoR3ZeSdSguHnB
(cherry picked from commit d9161764fb9a8f2b0866fb5f4f071a1192f6ae43)
[Niklas: ported to v7.3: module parameter .value() returns the value, not a reference]
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16_runtime.rs | 15 ++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16_runtime.rs b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16_runtime.rs
index ceb8dfb85765..cb9bd53e32d1 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16_runtime.rs
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16_runtime.rs
@@ -196,14 +196,23 @@ impl Bootstrap {
     /// Report each exhausted resource once, without logging every retry or
     /// enabling firmware KTrace (which changes command execution timing).
     fn report_pressure(&self, bit: u64, resource: &str) {
-        if crate::module_parameters::fw_trace.value() & 2 != 0
+        // Every resource here is released when work retires. Backpressure with
+        // nothing in flight can therefore never clear: it means an accounting
+        // leak, and submission stalls indefinitely with an idle GPU. Always
+        // report that, and event/ASID exhaustion, once per boot; transient
+        // ring and scene pressure under load stays behind fw_trace & 2.
+        let persistent = bit & (1 | 8) != 0 || self.flights.is_empty();
+        if (persistent || crate::module_parameters::fw_trace.value() & 2 != 0)
             && self.pressure_reported.fetch_or(bit, Ordering::Relaxed) & bit == 0
         {
+            let asids = (1..64).filter(|&i| self.context_users[i] != 0).count();
             dev_info!(
                 self.dev.as_ref(),
-                "G16: backpressure {} outstanding={}\n",
+                "G16: backpressure {} outstanding={} queue_events={}/32 asids={}/63\n",
                 resource,
-                self.flights.len()
+                self.flights.len(),
+                (self.queue_events.load(Ordering::Acquire) & 0xffff_ffff).count_ones(),
+                asids
             );
         }
     }
